[I] Download Youtube Videos

[T] youtubedr is a video downloader.

[U] https://github.com/kkdai/youtube

[A] Evan Lin
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] MIT
[V] 2.10.7

[D] 2e488823c58a195f64296b08749b8bbcf8cf448ade5584dc19f1cf9d youtube-2.10.7.tar.gz https://github.com/kkdai/youtube/archive/v2.10.7/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

var_append goconfopt ' ' "-o youtubedr ./cmd/youtubedr"
hook_add postmake 5 "cp -vf youtubedr $root$bindir/"
